      "role": "Section preamble text above headlines",
      "description": "F37 Bolton Medium at 14-16px, letter-spacing 0.05em, uppercase, color #0428cb on light backgrounds or #34fcff on dark. Sits 10-20px above the section headline, giving each band a two-tier entry: technical label then editorial headline."
